// groundOn give it (lit: the beam's share that reaches the face; sh, the shade's share, is one less it, held between nought and one, and every term carries it: nought
// is taken where the beam reaches whole; NO BRANCH: an early return here drew a black line at a wall's head, by test). The sky it sees: skyOn's own colour for the face,
// by one less the normal's height times what an upright face of its bearing has over half the level top's brightness (so its brightness comes to the level top's
