  // (THE FEET ON THE DRAWN BANK: each palm stands by the hump's own ridge line at its own z (bankRidge), its own draw ox to the east or west of it, its foot
  // at the hump's height there (bankY). Before, the row wound by the noise N0.n2(z / 700, bx) while the world's hump winds by a sine, and the foot was typed
  // at 0.5 with no test of the bank: of the 228 palms of the deal 7, 65 stood where no hump lay and 144 stood over or under the hump's face by more than
  // 0.05 m. The draws and their order are as they were.)
  rng = R.banks; const bankFrom = palms.length;
