// length inside its east end, two men aboard (mend 6); its start the last draw of the boats' stream.
// THE BARGE'S WATER (BARGE_WATER, above) and THE FERRY'S OVAL (FERRY_OVAL, below) are INVENTED and chosen: the
// barge's water is the marina's own, before the quay's steps and north of the drowned bank; the ferry's is the
